---
import { ecosystemProposals, featureDispatches } from '../data/feature-changelog';
import '../styles/feature-dispatch-feed.css';
---

<section class="dispatch-feed" id="field-dispatches" aria-labelledby="dispatch-title">
  <div class="dispatch-feed__intro">
    <p class="studio-kicker">Field dispatch · repository history</p>
    <h2 id="dispatch-title">Work in motion, recorded as it takes shape.</h2>
    <p>Recent implementation and research threads, read from their own repository histories. Each item marks a recorded change window; the larger program may still be in progress. A commit records changed source and any local checks, not deployment, independent acceptance, or universal effectiveness.</p>
  </div>

  <ol class="dispatch-list" aria-label="Feature changelog, newest first">
    {featureDispatches.map((entry, index) => (
      <li class="dispatch-card" id={`dispatch-${index + 1}`}>
        <article>
          <header class="dispatch-card__header">
            {entry.date.split(' → ').map((date, dateIndex) => <>
              {dateIndex > 0 && <span aria-hidden="true"> → </span>}
              <time datetime={date}>{date}</time>
            </>)}
            <span>{entry.repository}</span>
          </header>
          <h3>{entry.title}</h3>
          <p class="dispatch-card__summary">{entry.summary}</p>
          <ul class="dispatch-card__details">
            {entry.details.map((detail) => <li>{detail}</li>)}
          </ul>
          <footer class="dispatch-card__footer">
            <span>Local history refs: <code>{entry.evidence.join(' · ')}</code></span>
            <a href={entry.href}>Explore the related surface <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
          </footer>
        </article>
      </li>
    ))}
  </ol>

  <div class="dispatch-feed__ideas" aria-labelledby="dispatch-ideas-title">
    <p class="studio-kicker">Possible next instruments · proposals</p>
    <h3 id="dispatch-ideas-title">Twelve experiments for the wider workbench.</h3>
    <p>These are candidate directions, not an approved roadmap. Each starts with a small probe that could show whether the idea earns more scope.</p>
    <div class="dispatch-ideas-grid">
      {ecosystemProposals.map((proposal, index) => (
        <details class="dispatch-idea">
          <summary><span class="dispatch-idea__number">{String(index + 1).padStart(2, '0')}</span>{proposal.name}</summary>
          <p>{proposal.idea}</p>
          <p><strong>First probe:</strong> {proposal.firstProbe}</p>
        </details>
      ))}
    </div>
  </div>

  <p class="dispatch-feed__boundary">Source note: commit IDs identify local history reviewed for this draft and are not links to private code. This public-facing summary omits internal task details; repository state and acceptance may have moved since each record.</p>
</section>
